<p>Ae wafa ke paighambar nafse faatahe qaibar ae Hussain ke bhai<br />
Dekhiye zara uthkar , aah qaimae at&rsquo;har , lootne ko fouj aayi</p>

<p>Ho&rsquo;we aayae tatheer , jinke chehro ki tanweer, un se bigde yu taqdeer<br />
Farqe paak se chaadar, cheen le layee&rsquo;n badhkar, Qalq ho tamashaayi</p>

<p>Aapke kate shaane, koun iska gham jaane, koun hai jo pehchaane<br />
Shaahedeen ki dikhtar, aur is qadar muztar, us pa kaisi ban aayi</p>

<p>Khoo&rsquo;n hai kaano&rsquo;n se jaari, kaise jaaye bechaari, shaam ki hai tayyari<br />
Sailiyaa&rsquo;n padhe&rsquo;n rukh par, dar badar ba rehna sar, hai tumhaari shaidaai</p>

<p>Waasta payambar ka waasta bahattar ka , ya khuda wo din dikhla<br />
Dekhei&rsquo;n rouzae anwar, aur adaa kare qaisar , qidmate jabi&rsquo;n saayi<br />
</p>